          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145555,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la parola chiave che decide se un blocco di codice deve essere eseguito o meno?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145556,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi l'inizio dell'istruzione if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145557,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica la variabile che salta l'istruzione di visualizzazione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorUnlocked = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You open the treasure door!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>hasKey</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145558,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showHUD = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showHUD) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HUD enabled&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>HUD enabled</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>HUD enabled</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assembla le parentesi e inserisci una condizione che esegua il codice tra le parentesi graffe.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn an enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>true</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali operatori possiamo usare per fare confronti nelle condizioni delle istruzioni if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code> e <code>&amp;&amp;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessuno di questi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un confronto che visualizzi il testo se <code>playerHealth</code> è minore o uguale a <code>maxHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;maxHealth&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt;= maxHealth) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health is within limits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHealth</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>maxHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando confrontiamo due numeri di valori diversi con <code>===</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Otteniamo il booleano <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Otteniamo il booleano <code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Otteniamo un numero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Otteniamo il booleano <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché a volte dovremmo memorizzare i risultati dei confronti nelle variabili?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per riutilizzare i risultati dei confronti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Saltare sempre un blocco di codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per eseguire sempre un blocco di codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per riutilizzare i risultati dei confronti.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa una variabile che memorizza il risultato di un confronto come condizione dell'istruzione if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players &gt; 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMultiplayer = players &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isMultiplayer) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Choose characters for each player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>isMultiplayer</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la parte di un'istruzione <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> che viene eseguita quando la condizione dell'istruzione <code>if</code> è <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un'istruzione <code>else</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non esiste una condizione di questo tipo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un'istruzione <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un'istruzione <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un'istruzione <code>if</code> vuota (senza blocco di codice) che verifica se <code>gameState</code> è uguale a <code>\"paused\"</code>, seguita da un'istruzione <code>else</code> vuota.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else (gameState !== &quot;paused)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameState === \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>(gameState === \"paused\")</code> e poi <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché l'istruzione <code>else</code> non ha una propria condizione tra parentesi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché il suo blocco di codice verrà sempre eseguito se la condizione <code>if</code> non viene soddisfatta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché viene sempre eseguito, quindi non ha bisogno di una condizione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'istruzione <code>else</code> ha una condizione tra parentesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché il suo blocco di codice verrà sempre eseguito se la condizione <code>if</code> non viene soddisfatta.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando <code>enemyCount</code> ha un valore inferiore a 3?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyCount &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss fight unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>else</code> viene eseguito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>if</code> viene eseguito</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non viene eseguito né il blocco di codice <code>if</code> né il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>else</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>else</code> viene eseguito.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli un valore per <code>rageMeter</code> in modo che venga eseguito il blocco <code>else</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rageMeter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (rageMeter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enrage mode!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + bossName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not angry enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You are down!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low health warning.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Low health warning.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>You are down!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game over</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Low health warning.</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi le parole chiave per un'istruzione <code>else if</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial started.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies get tougher.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>else if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score === highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You tied the high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try again to beat the record!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Prova di nuovo a battere il record!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>New high score!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Hai pareggiato il punteggio più alto!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Prova di nuovo a battere il record!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza un messaggio nella console quando <code>gameMode</code> non è uguale a <code>\"survival\"</code> o <code>\"hardcore\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameMode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;story&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;survival&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No checkpoints.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;hardcore&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;One life only.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checkpoints enabled.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 145574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa succede quando le condizioni dell'istruzione <code>if</code> e delle istruzioni <code>else if</code> restituiscono <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; ammo &lt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is almost full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non viene visualizzato nulla nella console</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is almost full</code> viene visualizzato nella console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is full</code> viene visualizzato nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non viene visualizzato nulla nella console.</p></body></html>"
          }
